# Application configuration that every slice using JSON (@WebMvcTest, @JsonTest, ...) must include,
# because slices do not component-scan @Configuration classes (docs/adr/0015-testing-strategy.md).
# JsonBindingConfig: strict JSON types (ADR 0009). Without it a slice accepted 123 as "123".
com.shahabuddin.jobfinder.shared.api.JsonBindingConfig
